{"id":"w083","type":"colloc","domain":"work","phrase":"multicultural environment","answer":"multicultural","prompt":"working in a ___ environment","choices":["multicultural","multi-culture","many-cultural","multicultured"],"meaning":"môi trường đa văn hóa","example":"Working in a [multicultural] environment has broadened my perspective.","trap":"multi-culture environment","family":"Tính từ ghép"},
