{"id":"w085","type":"colloc","domain":"work","phrase":"time-consuming","answer":"time-consuming","prompt":"Manual checking is very ___","choices":["time-consuming","time-consumed","time-consumption","consuming-time"],"meaning":"tốn thời gian","example":"Checking every chair manually is very [time-consuming].","trap":"time-consumed","family":"Tính từ ghép"},
{"id":"w086","type":"colloc","domain":"work","phrase":"cost-effective","answer":"cost-effective","prompt":"a more ___ supplier","choices":["cost-effective","cost-efficiency","effective-cost","cost-effectively"],"meaning":"hiệu quả về chi phí","example":"We found a more [cost-effective] supplier for the steel.","trap":"cheaper-effective","family":"Tính từ ghép"},
{"id":"w087","type":"colloc","domain":"work","phrase":"take action","answer":"take","prompt":"___ immediate action","choices":["take","make","do","give"],"meaning":"hành động","example":"We must [take] immediate action to stop the leak.","trap":"make action","family":"take"},
{"id":"w088","type":"colloc","domain":"work","phrase":"make progress","answer":"make","prompt":"___ good progress this week","choices":["make","do","take","get"],"meaning":"đạt tiến triển","example":"The installation team needs to [make] good progress this week.","trap":"do progress / get progress","family":"make"},
{"id":"w089","type":"colloc","domain":"work","phrase":"pay attention to","answer":"pay","prompt":"___ attention to the tolerances","choices":["pay","make","take","put"],"meaning":"chú ý đến","example":"Please [pay] attention to the tolerances on the drawing.","trap":"take attention","family":"Họp"},
{"id":"w090","type":"colloc","domain":"work","phrase":"issue an NCR","answer":"issue","prompt":"___ a non-conformance report","choices":["issue","publish","launch","print"],"meaning":"phát hành báo cáo không phù hợp","example":"The consultant will [issue] a non-conformance report for the cracked frames.","trap":"publish an NCR","family":"Nghiệm thu"},
{"id":"i001","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"contribute to","answer":"to","prompt":"contribute ___ economic growth","choices":["to","for","in","on"],"meaning":"đóng góp vào","example":"New airports contribute [to] regional economic growth.","trap":"contribute for","family":"TO"},
{"id":"i002","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"lead to","answer":"to","prompt":"lead ___ traffic congestion","choices":["to","on","in","for"],"meaning":"dẫn đến","example":"Rapid urbanization can lead [to] serious traffic congestion.","trap":"lead to + V-ing, không phải lead to + V nguyên mẫu","family":"TO"},
{"id":"i003","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"result in","answer":"in","prompt":"result ___ higher costs","choices":["in","to","on","of"],"meaning":"dẫn đến (kết quả)","example":"Poor planning often results [in] higher costs.","trap":"result to","family":"IN"},
{"id":"i004","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"result from","answer":"from","prompt":"Many accidents result ___ fatigue","choices":["from","of","by","with"],"meaning":"bắt nguồn từ","example":"Many site accidents result [from] fatigue.","trap":"result of fatigue (as a result of mới có of)","family":"FROM"},
{"id":"i005","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"benefit from","answer":"from","prompt":"Residents benefit ___ new infrastructure","choices":["from","of","with","to"],"meaning":"được hưởng lợi từ","example":"Local residents benefit [from] new transport infrastructure.","trap":"benefit of","family":"FROM"},
{"id":"i006","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"have an effect on","answer":"on","prompt":"have a negative effect ___ health","choices":["on","to","in","for"],"meaning":"có ảnh hưởng đến","example":"Long working hours have a negative effect [on] health.","trap":"effect to health","family":"ON"},
{"id":"i007","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"concerned about","answer":"about","prompt":"People are concerned ___ air pollution","choices":["about","of","at","on"],"meaning":"lo ngại về","example":"Many people are concerned [about] air pollution in big cities.","trap":"concerned of","family":"ABOUT"},
{"id":"i008","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"opposed to","answer":"to","prompt":"Residents are opposed ___ the new airport","choices":["to","against","with","for"],"meaning":"phản đối","example":"Some residents are strongly opposed [to] the new runway.","trap":"opposed against","family":"TO"},
{"id":"i009","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"in the long run","answer":"in","prompt":"___ the long run, it saves money","choices":["in","on","at","for"],"meaning":"về lâu dài","example":"[In] the long run, green buildings save money.","trap":"on the long run","family":"IN"},
{"id":"i010","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"on the other hand","answer":"On","prompt":"___ the other hand, costs are higher","choices":["On","In","At","By"],"meaning":"mặt khác","example":"[On] the other hand, the initial costs are much higher.","trap":"in the other hand","family":"ON"},
{"id":"i011","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"access to","answer":"to","prompt":"access ___ clean water","choices":["to","for","of","into"],"meaning":"tiếp cận với (danh từ)","example":"Millions of people still lack access [to] clean water.","trap":"access for / access into (động từ access không có giới từ)","family":"TO"},
{"id":"i012","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"a solution to","answer":"to","prompt":"a long-term solution ___ the problem","choices":["to","of","on","at"],"meaning":"giải pháp cho","example":"There is no simple solution [to] traffic congestion.","trap":"solution of the problem","family":"TO"},
