{"id":"i015","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"prevent someone from","answer":"from","prompt":"prevent workers ___ entering","choices":["from","to","of","against"],"meaning":"ngăn ai làm gì","example":"Fences prevent the public [from] entering the site.","trap":"prevent workers to enter","family":"FROM"},
{"id":"i016","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"at the expense of","answer":"at","prompt":"speed ___ the expense of quality","choices":["at","on","in","by"],"meaning":"đánh đổi bằng, với cái giá là","example":"Speed should not come [at] the expense of quality.","trap":"on the expense of","family":"AT"},
