{"id":"i024","type":"prep","domain":"ielts","phrase":"with regard to","answer":"With","prompt":"___ regard to safety, ...","choices":["With","On","For","At"],"meaning":"về vấn đề, liên quan đến","example":"[With] regard to safety, the new system is far better.","trap":"with regards of","family":"WITH"},
