{"id":"i059","type":"colloc","domain":"ielts","phrase":"outweigh the drawbacks","answer":"outweigh","prompt":"The benefits ___ the drawbacks","choices":["outweigh","overweight","outweight","weigh out"],"meaning":"lớn hơn, vượt trội hơn","example":"In my view, the benefits [outweigh] the drawbacks.","trap":"overweight the drawbacks","family":"Học thuật"},
{"id":"i060","type":"colloc","domain":"ielts","phrase":"exert pressure on","answer":"exert","prompt":"___ pressure on the government","choices":["exert","make","do","give"],"meaning":"gây áp lực lên","example":"Residents can [exert] pressure on the government.","trap":"make pressure on","family":"Học thuật"}
